  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:order" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">征西大將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:order:m0005" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲太尉。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:called" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">二月己丑，太尉、征西將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:called:m0012" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>帥師伐關中。廢揚州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:called:m0025" ref="djo_u3b_i9w_A">殷浩</persName>爲庶人，</p>
</text>
